                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkabela cibe ciindi cakamubotela kundiyubunwida Mwanaakwe, kuti nkamukambauke akati kabamasi, elyo ndilyonya teendakabuzyanya makani abantu balya maila, ",
          "type": "text",
