              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alimwi teendakaya ku-Jerusalemu kulibaabo ibakandisaangunina kuba baapostolo, pele ndakaya ku-Arabiya, lino nicakaba ciindi ndakaboola ku-Damasko.",
          "type": "text",
